@startuml j11-customer-tools
title J11 Customer tools: totals, call, chat, change the phone number, delete with Undo (v1.2)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantFontColor #0B3D2E
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorFontColor #0B3D2E
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupHeaderFontColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
  DividerBorderColor #0E5C45
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  DividerFontColor #0B3D2E
  BoxBorderColor #0E5C45
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #0E5C45
  BackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Shop owner" as Owner
participant "Browser UI\n(index.html)" as UI
participant "app.js" as App
database "localStorage" as LS
participant "WhatsApp / phone app" as WA
autonumber
note over App, LS : v1.2 add-on customer.js, through the window.Hisaab hooks of app.js.\nNothing new is stored: the customer and the entries stay under 'hisaab.v1'.
== Open a customer ==
Owner -> UI : open a customer (#/c/<phone>)
UI -> App : render the customer page
App -> LS : getItem('hisaab.v1')
LS --> App : the customer and their entries
App -> UI : after the entries, the block #cust-tools (customer.js): total given on credit,\ntotal received, days since the last payment or "No payment yet"
== Call or chat ==
opt Call
  Owner -> UI : tap Call
  UI -> WA : open tel:+91<phone>
end
opt WhatsApp chat
  Owner -> UI : tap WhatsApp chat
  UI -> WA : open https://wa.me/91<phone> with no message
  note right of WA : the reminder link with the balance is\nthe separate existing button (J4)
end
== Change phone number ==
Owner -> UI : press Change phone number, type a new 10-digit number,\npress Save number
UI -> App : click (customer.js)
alt not 10 digits
  App -> UI : refused: the number must have 10 digits
else another customer has this number
  App -> UI : refused: another customer already has it
else accepted
  App -> App : the customer and every entry of that customer move to the new number
  App -> LS : save(): setItem('hisaab.v1', state)
  App -> UI : the page address becomes #/c/<new number>; render()
end
== Delete customer ==
Owner -> UI : press Delete customer
UI -> Owner : first press: nothing is removed yet; the button asks\n"Press again to delete ... and all their entries"
Owner -> UI : press a second time within 5 s\n(a double tap within 0.7 s counts as one press)
UI -> App : click (customer.js)
App -> App : keep a copy; remove the customer and all their entries
App -> LS : save(): setItem('hisaab.v1', state)
App -> UI : go to the overview; a bar "Deleted ..." with Undo (8 s)
alt Undo pressed within 8 s
  Owner -> UI : tap Undo
  UI -> App : put the customer and the same entries back
  App -> LS : save()
  App -> UI : render(); the bar says "Restored ..." for 3 s
else 8 s pass
  App -> UI : the bar is hidden; the customer stays deleted
end
note over UI, App : the total outstanding on the overview follows each of these:\nthe new number, the delete and the Undo
@enduml
